{"3310530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fairground Online", "steam_appid": 3310530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4791580], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairground Online – Your Ultimate Ride Simulator!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairground Online is a realistic fairground and ride simulation in which you take control of impressive attractions and experience a lively amusement park together with other players. Operate rides just like on real fairgrounds, create spectacular light shows, and deliver unforgettable moments for your visitors.<br>From a relaxed family day to a glowing fairground night, every session offers new experiences in a dynamic and atmospheric amusement park world.<br>Take on the role of a real showman and control highly detailed rides directly from the operator’s control panel. Adjust movements and sequences and ensure the perfect ride experience for your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the fairground together with other players in a lively online world. Explore the festival grounds together or take control of your favorite rides yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Ride Physics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/a1f5f862d557114e3fcbae6b5e8008ed.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/a1f5f862d557114e3fcbae6b5e8008ed.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/a1f5f862d557114e3fcbae6b5e8008ed.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience rides that move and behave realistically. Acceleration, rotation, centrifugal forces, and ride-specific motion patterns have been designed to authentically recreate the feeling of real fairground attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/70b15cce0c191cb17889ac9006fcac1b.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/70b15cce0c191cb17889ac9006fcac1b.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/70b15cce0c191cb17889ac9006fcac1b.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each ride features its own detailed control panel. Control speed, direction of rotation, and various functions just like on a real fairground, while maintaining full control over the ride experience at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light Control:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/868cc2f7cc280f59165a1abb1ea40ff8.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/868cc2f7cc280f59165a1abb1ea40ff8.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/868cc2f7cc280f59165a1abb1ea40ff8.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Give your attractions their own character. Switch individual lighting elements on or off and create impressive light shows that provide a unique atmosphere, especially in the evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Jingles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/1b2c08085d09878f159b359f96a72e76.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/1b2c08085d09878f159b359f96a72e76.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/1b2c08085d09878f159b359f96a72e76.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A fairground wouldn’t be complete without music. Choose suitable tracks and jingles to ensure your attractions not only look spectacular but also sound the part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/a229d4528bccf96181e4f86ebe1c530c.poster.avif?t=1783007955