as a showman begins.<br>Welcome to Fairground Online.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairground Online – Your Ultimate Ride Simulator!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairground Online is a realistic fairground and ride simulation in which you take control of impressive attractions and experience a lively amusement park together with other players. Operate rides just like on real fairgrounds, create spectacular light shows, and deliver unforgettable moments for your visitors.<br>From a relaxed family day to a glowing fairground night, every session offers new experiences in a dynamic and atmospheric amusement park world.<br>Take on the role of a real showman and control highly detailed rides directly from the operator’s control panel. Adjust movements and sequences and ensure the perfect ride experience for your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.poster.avif?t=1783007955\" width=1080 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.webm?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/extras/6e365fd61d06eab1b45a92de358b9e04.mp4?t=1783007955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the fairground together with other players in a lively online world. Explore the festival grounds together or take control of your favorite rides yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Ride Physics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka